# ...but not the whole-program cases: their Makefile IS the test, it says how a
# Haard program becomes a binary, and the CMake rule above was swallowing it.
!tests/programs/cases/*/Makefile

# ...and the bootstrap's, which is how the compiler written in Haard is built
!bootstrap/Makefile

